# Applies only to Dockerfile.cicd (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). The legacy ./Dockerfile build keeps
# its current context. The Angular environment comes from the `frontend_environment` build secret, never from here.

# Per-environment configuration and secrets
src/environments/environment*.ts
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Local artifacts
**/node_modules
dist
.angular
coverage
**/.DS_Store

# Not needed by the image (assets under src/ are kept, including their .md files)
.git
.vscode
/*.md
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.cicd
*.dockerignore
sonar-project.properties
